  /// PersonPanel · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~42 characters
  /// shown through Field.label
  /// beside: "Cancel"
  label "Why (recorded with the change)" => "السبب (يُسجَّل مع التغيير)";
  /// PersonPanel · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~63 characters
  /// shown through Field.label
  /// beside: "Cancel"
  label "Why — who asked, and how you knew it was them" => "السبب: من طلب ذلك، وكيف عرفت أنه هو";
  /// PersonPanel · placeholder text inside an empty field · at most ~73 characters
  /// shown through Field.placeholder
  /// beside: "Cancel"
  placeholder "Lost phone; confirmed on a call from her desk number" => "فقدت هاتفها؛ تم التأكد عبر مكالمة من رقم مكتبها";
  /// PersonPanel · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "Every session they have ends, on every device. They can sign in again." => "ستنتهي كل جلساته، على كل الأجهزة. ويمكنه تسجيل الدخول مجددًا.";
  /// PersonPanel · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "Their authenticator app and recovery codes stop working; they set it up again at their next sign-in. Do this only when you are sure it is them asking." => "سيتوقف تطبيق المصادقة ورموز الاسترداد الخاصة به عن العمل، وسيعيد إعداده عند تسجيل دخوله التالي. لا تفعل ذلك إلا إذا كنت متأكدًا من أنه هو من يطلب.";
  /// PersonPanel · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "They can sign in again with the password they had." => "يمكنه تسجيل الدخول مجددًا بكلمة المرور التي كانت لديه.";
  /// PersonPanel · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "They cannot sign in, and every session they have ends. Their work stays theirs." => "لن يتمكن من تسجيل الدخول، وستنتهي كل جلساته. يبقى عمله باسمه.";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  text "Give a role" => "منح دور";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  /// beside: "Signing in"
  text "Has never signed in." => "لم يسجّل الدخول قط.";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  text "History" => "السجل";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {ToString} = d.LastSignIn.Value.ToString(…)
  /// beside: "Signing in"
  text "Last signed in {ToString}." => "آخر تسجيل دخول {ToString}.";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  text "No changes to their access yet." => "لا توجد تغييرات على صلاحياته بعد.";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  text "No roles — they can sign in, and do nothing that needs one." => "بلا أدوار: يمكنه تسجيل الدخول، ولا يمكنه فعل أي شيء يتطلب دورًا.";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  /// beside: "Signing in"
  text "Not signed in anywhere right now." => "غير مسجّل الدخول في أي مكان الآن.";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  /// beside: "Signing in"
  text "Signed in on 1 browser or device right now." => "مسجّل الدخول على متصفح أو جهاز واحد الآن.";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {d.SignedIn} = d.SignedIn
  /// beside: "Signing in"
  text "Signed in on {d.SignedIn} browsers or devices right now." => "عدد المتصفحات أو الأجهزة المسجّل الدخول عليها الآن: {d.SignedIn}.";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  text "Signing in" => "تسجيل الدخول";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {d.Name} = d.Name
  /// shown through done
  text "Two-step sign-in was reset for {d.Name}; they set it up again when they next sign in." => "أُعيد تعيين تسجيل الدخول بخطوتين لـ {d.Name}؛ وسيعيد إعداده عند تسجيل دخوله التالي.";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {r.Organization} = r.Organization
  text "at {r.Organization}" => "في {r.Organization}";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {e.By} = e.By, {value} = …
  /// also in AccessTrailList
  text "by {e.By}{value}" => "بواسطة {e.By}{value}";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {d.Name} = d.Name
  /// shown through done
  text "{d.Name} can no longer sign in, and was signed out everywhere." => "لم يعد بإمكان {d.Name} تسجيل الدخول، وتم تسجيل خروجه من كل مكان.";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {d.Name} = d.Name
  /// shown through done
  text "{d.Name} can sign in again." => "يمكن لـ {d.Name} تسجيل الدخول مجددًا.";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {d.Name} = d.Name, {giving.Label} = giving.Label
  /// shown through done
  text "{d.Name} is now {giving.Label}." => "أصبح {d.Name} الآن {giving.Label}.";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {d.Name} = d.Name
  /// shown through done
  text "{d.Name} was signed out everywhere." => "تم تسجيل خروج {d.Name} من كل مكان.";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {r.Label} = r.Label, {d.Name} = d.Name
  /// shown through done
  text "{r.Label} was taken from {d.Name}." => "سُحب دور {r.Label} من {d.Name}.";
  /// PersonPanel · a title
  /// placeholders: {d.Name} = d.Name
  /// shown through Dialog.title
  title "Deactivate {d.Name}?" => "تعطيل {d.Name}؟";
  /// PersonPanel · a title
  /// placeholders: {d.Name} = d.Name
  /// shown through Dialog.title
  title "Reactivate {d.Name}?" => "إعادة تفعيل {d.Name}؟";
  /// PersonPanel · a title
